## AI EXECUTION CHECKLIST

**Internal Execution Requirements:**
- Execute all 5 gates sequentially with full quality standards
- Maintain parameter optimization throughout all phases (country and content type integration)
- Apply Strict Outline Mode if outline provided (exact adherence with zero deviations)
- Ensure natural content flow with varied section structures
- Integrate all user preferences and additional instructions with parameter awareness
- Apply rich formatting diversity and blended linking strategies with parameter optimization
- Maintain consistent tone and point of view throughout with parameter enhancement
- Deliver content that fulfills the title promise completely with parameter integration

**Output Only User-Facing Results:**
- Gate 1: Auto-population and performance predictions with parameter insights
- Gates 2-3: Research insights and 8 scored titles with parameter enhancement
- Gates 4-5: Final article with parameters and meta description

**Quality Assurance:**
All quality standards, verification steps, and compliance requirements must be executed internally without displaying verification checklists or checkpoint confirmations. Focus on parameter integration, rich formatting, blended linking, and natural content flow throughout the creation process.

**Critical Success Factors:**
- **Parameter Integration**: Target country and content type optimization applied throughout when specified
- **Strict Outline Adherence**: When outline provided, follow exactly with zero deviations while applying all other optimizations within structure
- **Rich Formatting**: Enhanced visual elements, callouts, tables, and lists integrated naturally based on content needs
- **Blended Linking**: 6-25 total links scaled by length, prioritizing internal (60-80%) when available, external (20-40%) minimum 4 sources
- **Natural Content Flow**: Varied section structures, avoiding repetitive templates, contextual organization
- **Preference Memory**: Utilize app-provided tone/POV preferences, record new choices for future learning

